{"ts":"2026-08-25T05:09:49.804Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-5.6-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9b054e739855a3b67742faac","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-5.6-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-a8zm","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Surface contract\n\n- tools/list, prompts/list, resources/list, resources/read, and resources/templates/list return ttlMs and public or private cacheScope.\n- Tool ordering is deterministic and stable enough for prompt caches.\n- listChanged and subscriptions/listen invalidation align with TTL hints and never allow stale authorization decisions.\n- inputSchema and outputSchema accept applicable JSON Schema 2020-12 keywords and resolve references under bounded depth, bytes, and composition work.\n- structuredContent accepts any JSON value while tool result envelopes remain predictable.\n- Resource-not-found returns Invalid Params and recovery identifies the missing URI without leaking unrelated resources.\n- Contract generation, SDK types, MCP tool definitions, docs, golden files, and packed artifacts derive from one source."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-hv1x1x"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"MCP server surface and cache contracts: deterministic tools, prompts, resources, JSON Schema 2020-12, ttlMs, cacheScope, and change coherence"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Bring every pm MCP list/read/call surface onto the 2026-07-28 schema and caching contract with deterministic ordering, broad JSON Schema support, safe references, and coherent invalidation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:mcp","caching","determinism","json-schema","prompts","resources","token-efficiency","tools"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-25T05:09:49.804Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-25T05:09:49.804Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":780},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Every cacheable result includes validated ttlMs and cacheScope with documented freshness and privacy semantics; Tool listing is deterministic and cache invalidation composes correctly with listChanged and subscriptions/listen; JSON Schema 2020-12 references and composition keywords work within explicit recursion, size, and work bounds; structuredContent accepts every JSON value and schema-validation refusals are actionable and token-bounded; Resource-not-found uses Invalid Params and never leaks resource existence outside caller authority; SDK, MCP, docs, generated schemas, golden snapshots, and packed artifacts prove one shared contract"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"Complete cacheable deterministic server features"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Make tool, prompt, resource, template, and read results conformant, bounded, cache-safe, and generated from shared SDK contracts"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Clients spend fewer tokens and requests while preserving exact freshness, privacy, and schema semantics"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The new revision requires ttlMs and cacheScope on cacheable results, deterministic tool ordering, broader JSON Schema 2020-12 behavior, and different resource-not-found errors"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-rs9vry"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-5t33or","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:09:49.804Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-usfg","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:09:49.804Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-vae5ec","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:09:49.804Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-yf07b7","kind":"supersedes","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:09:49.804Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-25T05:09:49.804Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check evidence: searched all statuses for ttlMs cacheScope deterministic tools/list JSON Schema 2020-12 structuredContent references composition bounds and resource not found. pm-yf07b7 delivered the earlier resource and prompt surface but not the new revision contract."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"af82a5540432a72244f2d36f23cc40e30b297ef5341060759500a56366f692e4","item_hash_version":2,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
